<title>NETHERLANDS: Pirelli Tyre says sees improved H2.</title>
<headline>Pirelli Tyre says sees improved H2.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pirelli-Tyre Holding NV said on Thursday it expected a further improvement in second-half results, in line with the market.  </p>
<p>&quot;The expectation is that the positive trend in results will continue in the second half, to the same degree as the market,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company said that over the coming months economic growth in the various geographical regions would likely vary, and that results in the tyre markets were expected to largely follow overall economic developments.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
